comments.body:
[WARGAMING] I attacked CU1, CU2, CU3, CU5, CU6, CU7 and CU8 along alternative and failure paths:
- switching language with the lightbox open and with items in the cart;
- localStorage throwing an exception;
- navigator.language set to en-GB, es-419 and undefined;
- /admin with EN selected;
- server errors in EN;
- a product name typed by hand;
- a printOnly photo in EN;
- an empty cart in EN;
- /pedido in EN;
- a byte-for-byte regression check of the Spanish WhatsApp message (identical);
- the time zone of an event created from UTC-3;
- the TopBar at 360, 390, 780 and 1280 px.

Verdict: REQUEST-CHANGES. Tests 116/116 and vue-tsc clean. Spanish and admin are unchanged.
[FINDING-HIGH: R-1] CU2: at 390 px the TopBar takes 3 rows (components.css:159-180). It fits in 2 only below 380 px.
[FINDING-HIGH: R-2] The UAT is missing (requires_uat).
MEDIUM R-3: a final PayPal error in EN loses the reference id (serverErrors.ts:17-24,31). Latent, since PayPal is off.
MEDIUM R-4: formatting event dates in Guayaquil time shows the previous day for events created from UTC-3 (format.ts:12-13).
LOW:
- R-5: error strings don't re-translate, and the pending notice in Checkout turns into a danger alert.
- R-6: product names typed by hand stay in Spanish.
- R-7: format.ts duplicates DIGITAL_NAME and packName.
- R-8: downloadNotice is coupled to the server text.
- R-9: approximate EN errors.
- R-10: "03:30 PM" should be "3:30 PM"; "Social Communication" should be "Communication Studies".

[WARGAMING] I re-reviewed fixes c6e649f and 98a4975. I attacked CU2, CU3, CU5, CU7 and CU8 on alternative and failure paths:
- the TopBar at the 360/380 and 459/460 boundaries, in both languages (14 screenshots), including a 2-digit counter at es-380;
- an event created from UTC-3;
- the final PayPal error in EN, with and without the id;
- switching languages after an error in Cart, Descargas, Order and Checkout;
- product names that look like the system names;
- an unknown download notice;
- a byte-for-byte check of the Spanish WhatsApp message against 6c516e0 (ALL_SAME true);
- admin amounts ("5.00").

Verdict: APPROVE. Tests 116/116, vue-tsc clean. R-1, R-3, R-4, R-5, R-7, R-8 and R-10 are resolved.
[FINDING-HIGH: R-2] still open: UAT with the human is missing.
LOW:
- L-1: Checkout messages are still stored as strings (PayPal is off).
- L-2: the ES/EN buttons are 28 px wide in the 380–459 range.
